# UX workflow: local random visualization on the sequencer grid.
# Purpose: captures simple, cycle-state, and micro-sequence steps whose
# representative StepNode carries a local pitch random range.
# Expect: playhead_progress

0 scenario seq-local-random-grid
80 capture screen local_random_grid_ready

180 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
520 capture screen local_random_grid_playing
760 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
960 capture screen local_random_grid_stopped
